This is a community-maintained Caddy module and is not an official CrowdSec
or Caddy component. RentnerProxy applies the documented source transform shipped
at docker/crowdsec/tooling/caddy-http-only.sh so that only its HTTP enforcement module
is linked; AppSec and Layer 4 are not included.
